OL,3,GNEWSACouncil unanimously rejects
OL,4,Atourist tax amid visitor concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has unanimously voted against
OL,7,Fintroducing a tourist tax, warning it
OL,8,Fcould deter visitors and damage the
OL,9,Flocal hospitality industry.
OL,11,FFylde Council rejected the proposal at
OL,12,Fa meeting on Tuesday, arguing a levy on
OL,13,Fovernight stays would have a
OL,14,Fdetrimental impact on tourism and local
OL,15,Fbusinesses.
OL,17,FUnder the government's Visitor Levy
OL,18,FBill mayors and council leaders would
OL,19,Fbe able to introduce a small fee on
OL,20,Fovernight stays in their local areas -
OL,21,Fsomething that has previously been
OL,22,Fenforced in Edinburgh.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
